      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your fur is as pale as death, possibly from some connection you or your family has to the afterlife, which lets you supernaturally find your way. You can cast Know the Way as an occult innate spell at will. A cantrip is heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up. In addition, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus against spells or effects that cause the Confused condition."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
